The FortisNet package selects upstream executables for its restricted OCI
profile. Only debug information and ELF section-table metadata are removed;
program headers, allocated runtime sections and other mapped bytes are verified
unchanged. Upstream source and archive identities remain in the package manifest.

LICENSE is the upstream Apache-2.0 license. GO-BSD-LICENSE preserves the
Go Authors BSD notice used in gVisor's safecopy, sync and sentry/time packages.
Retain the upstream notices and dependency notices applicable to redistribution.
